MODULE cli

FUNCTION run command line
    with no arguments, show the explained menu on a terminal or help on a pipe
    with -test, run only the offline built-in checks
    otherwise dispatch exactly one documented command and validate its arity

Commands install and update resolve then install a profile. List reports each
package's health. Plan reports selected immutable assets without changing
state. Remove uses recoverable trash. Doctor independently validates the
catalog, then checks a compatible lock, every locked cache object, receipts,
and installed tools without repair; an absent cache object is informational
while a present invalid object is an error. Config explains every setting. Env
prints shell activation. Shell opens a prepared child shell. Pack creates an
offline ZIP. Restore validates and installs one. Help explains every command.

FUNCTION interactive menu
    repeatedly explain actions 1 through 6
    run the selected default-profile action
    report a failed action without terminating the menu
    exit only for selection 6 or end-of-input
